<p>{{ site.name }} is free to read. We plan to fund it with display advertising, such as Google AdSense, and may in the future use affiliate links.</p>
<ul>
<li>Advertisers do not choose, review or influence which players we report as expected or confirmed starters.</li>
<li>Ads are visually separated from articles and labeled as advertising.</li>
<li>We do not accept payment for coverage, and we do not run sportsbook promotions in articles.</li>
<li>If an article ever contains an affiliate link, it will be disclosed in that article, as the Federal Trade Commission requires.</li>
</ul>
<p>Questions go through our <a href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">contact form</a>.</p>
